Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-yaml, python3-dotenv, adduser
Description: Headless service daemon for AI Runner (services only)
 The services/ package surface of AIRunner: headless orchestration layer
 owning the daemon entry points, FastAPI server wiring, runtime registry,
 downloads, persistence, lifecycle control, and modality services.
 .
 This package is services only (issue #2237): it ships the
 airunner-daemon, airunner-headless and airunner-service console scripts
 plus the airunner-headless systemd unit. It deliberately contains no Qt
 desktop client. It also ships airunner-common 6.1.7 as files (see
 debian/vendor/README.source) until that project publishes its own
 Debian binary. Heavy ML extras (torch, diffusers, llama.cpp bindings)
 are not Debian-packaged; without torch the daemon still boots and
 serves /health plus sidecar-backed modalities, while local generation
 endpoints report missing-runtime diagnostics (issue #2243).
